OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being seriously
OL,4,Ainjured at Edinburgh film studio
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being seriously
OL,7,Finjured at a film studio in Edinburgh.
OL,9,FEmergency crews were called to
OL,10,FFirstStage studio in Leith at about
OL,11,F15:00 on Thursday.
OL,13,FThe man, who has not been named, was
OL,14,Fpronounced dead a short time later.
OL,16,FPolice Scotland said the death was not
OL,17,Fbeing treated as suspicious but
OL,18,Finquiries into the circumstances were
OL,19,Fongoing.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
